   "sourceHash": "fb05e40892d6cb65e03d47363a638656f58c7462c469f937377bea67bd2cad2b",
   "text": "削弱身体吸收阿育吠陀疗法和草本外用疗效的能力",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
